  <p class="gd-byline" style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--blue-soft);opacity:.9;margin:16px 0 0">By <a href="/about" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px">Heliski Travel Team</a> · Updated 13 Aug 2026</p>
  <p class="gd-lede">A heli-ski trip for two is one of the great shared adventures: untracked mountains by day, a comfortable fjord lodge by night, and a memory you keep for life. It works whether you ski at the same level or not, whether both of you ski or only one, and it makes a superb honeymoon or milestone. This is how to plan a couples' heli-ski trip in Iceland with Heliski Travel, before you look at <a href="/packages">the packages</a>.</p>
